ich is just fake data \n8. its kinda clumsy can u fix it?\n9. broo i got few matlab scripts with me can they be useful?\n10. these are the names\n\n<summary>\n# Continuation Summary: Autonomous Industrial Quality Intelligence & Root-\n<truncated 4496 bytes>\nmlit`, `ultralytics`, `torch`, `plotly`, `pandas`, `openpyxl`, `xlrd`, `opencv-python`, `pillow`.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Next Steps\n1. **Explain the MATLAB files to the user**:\n   - Clarify that these are **ANN Surrogate Metamodels** trained to approximate the Arena simulation models (e.g., predicting Drilling, Milling, and Assembly queue times/utilization from process inputs).\n   - Explain that they are valuable because they allow building a **Real-Time Neural Digital Twin** in Streamlit.\n2. **Offer Integration Options**:\n   - **Option A (Port to Python ANN Metamodels)**: Read the weights/formulas from `Model1ANN.m`, `Model2ANN*.m`, and `c*s*ANN.m` into a lightweight Python neural predictor module (`modules/ann_surrogate.py`) to give users real-time interactive parameter optimization sliders.\n   - **Option B (Comparison & Validation)**: Compare the ANN surrogate predictions against the real CSV/XLSX Arena simulation runs in Tab 2.\n3. **Implement Selected Integration**: Port the ANN mathematical forward pass into NumPy/PyTorch once the user provides code/permission or asks to proceed.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- **NO emojis** anywhere in the UI or code.\n- **NO \"NEURAX 3.0\"** titles.\n- Keep the UI streamlined, futuristic, clean, and responsive.\n- Bounding box detection must remain 100% operational for all defect classes.\n- Spreadsheet parsing must handle `.csv`, `.xlsx`, and `.xls` seamlessly.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 3 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1789840749044]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/win-10/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f365fb6f-b130-4162-803f-d8faca0d55a2/.user_uploaded/media_1789840749044.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-19T17:59:23Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: